{"seq":1,"slug":"structural-chemistry","title":"结构化学","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/high-school/science-track/chemistry-advanced/structural-chemistry","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"atomic-orbitals","title":"理科方向 化学进阶 — 原子轨道与电子构型","url":"/l-doc-books/education/high-school/science-track/chemistry-advanced/structural-chemistry/atomic-orbitals","wordCount":2051,"readingTime":9},{"seq":2,"slug":"chemical-bonding","title":"理科方向 化学进阶 — 化学键理论","url":"/l-doc-books/education/high-school/science-track/chemistry-advanced/structural-chemistry/chemical-bonding","wordCount":2043,"readingTime":9},{"seq":3,"slug":"crystal-structure","title":"理科方向 化学进阶 — 晶体结构","url":"/l-doc-books/education/high-school/science-track/chemistry-advanced/structural-chemistry/crystal-structure","wordCount":2278,"readingTime":10}],"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"结构化学-简介\">结构化学 简介</h1><p>本章从量子力学的视角重新理解原子和分子的微观结构，是从高中化学的&quot;描述性规律&quot;走向&quot;解释性原理&quot;的关键转折。高中化学课程讲授了电子排布、化学键类型和分子极性等概念，但对其背后的理论基础介绍较少。结构化学用轨道理论统一解释这些现象，让学生不仅知道&quot;是什么&quot;，更能理解&quot;为什么&quot;。</p>\n<p>本章包含三个小节。<strong>原子轨道与电子构型</strong>从薛定谔方程的解出发，讲解氢原子的量子数体系和原子轨道的形状特征，分析多电子原子中的屏蔽效应和钻穿效应如何影响电子填充顺序，用构造原理、洪特规则和泡利不相容原理系统解释元素周期表中原子性质的周期性变化规律，帮助学生建立精确的电子构型分析能力。<strong>化学键理论</strong>对比讲解价键理论和分子轨道理论两大化学键描述框架，详细分析杂化轨道理论（sp、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>s</mi><msup><mi>p</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">sp^2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0085em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>s</mi><msup><mi>p</mi><mn>3</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">sp^3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0085em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 杂化）对分子几何构型的预测方法，介绍分子轨道理论中成键轨道和反键轨道的概念及其对键级和磁性的解释力，讨论金属键的自由电子模型和能带理论初步。<strong>晶体结构</strong>讲解离子晶体、分子晶体、原子晶体和金属晶体的结构特征与性质差异，分析晶格能的概念和影响因素，介绍配位化合物的结构和晶体场理论对颜色、磁性的解释，帮助学生理解固态物质中结构与性质的定量关系。</p>\n<p>建议按照原子结构、化学键、晶体的顺序学习，这三个层次恰好对应从单个原子到分子再到固体的认识路径。理论性较强，建议结合具体化合物实例加深理解。</p>\n"}